{"book":"Mark","chapter":8,"translation":"KJV","url":"/bible/mark/8","verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"In those days the multitude being very great, and having nothing to eat, Jesus called his disciples unto him, and saith unto them,","words":[["In",["G1722"]],["those",["G1565"]],["days",["G2250"]],["the multitude",["G3793"]],["being",["G5607"]],["very great,",["G3827"]],["and",["G2532"]],["having",["G2192"]],["nothing",["G3361","G5101"]],["to eat,",["G5315"]],["Jesus",["G2424"]],["called",["G4341"]],["his",["G846"]],["disciples",["G3101"]],["unto him, and saith",["G3004"]],["unto them,",[]]]},{"verse":2,"text":"I have compassion on the multitude, because they have now been with me three days, and have nothing to eat:","words":[["I have compassion",["G4697"]],["on",["G1909"]],["the multitude,",["G3793"]],["because",["G3754"]],["they have",["G4357"]],["now",["G2235"]],["been",["G4357"]],["with me",["G3427"]],["three",["G5140"]],["days,",["G2250"]],["and",["G2532"]],["have",["G2192"]],["nothing",["G3756","G5101"]],["to eat:",[]]]},{"verse":3,"text":"And if I send them away fasting to their own houses, they will faint by the way: for divers of them came from far.","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["if",["G1437"]],["I send",["G630"]],["them",["G846"]],["away",["G630"]],["fasting",["G3523"]],["to",["G1519"]],["their own",["G846"]],["houses,",["G3624"]],["they will faint",["G1590"]],["by",["G1722"]],["the way:",["G3598"]],["for",["G1063"]],["divers",["G5100"]],["of them",["G846"]],["came",["G2240"]],["from far.",[]]]},{"verse":4,"text":"And his disciples answered him, From whence can a man satisfy these men with bread here in the wilderness?","words":[["And",["G2532"]],["his",["G846"]],["disciples",["G3101"]],["answered",["G611"]],["him,",["G846"]],["From whence",["G4159"]],["can",["G1410"]],["a man",["G5100"]],["satisfy",["G5526"]],["these",["G5128"]],["men with bread",["G740"]],["here",["G5602"]],["in",["G1909"]],["the wilderness?",[]]]},{"verse":5,"text":"And he asked them, How m